invariant: INV-16
file: poly1305.c
catches: test/lint-wide-multiply.sh
reason: a quotient under a condition: clang folds the branch into an IT
  block and emits udivne on the M3, a mnemonic the gate's old
  word-boundary match did not count (udiv is followed by a letter, not a
  boundary); the gate now matches each opcode as a prefix of the mnemonic

--- old
    size_t whole = n & ~(size_t)15;
--- new
    size_t whole = (n & 1) ? n / p->fill : n;
